# Sandevistan
sandevistan-no-stamina = Not enough stamina to start the neural booster!
sandevistan-force-activate = Forced start: Nervous system overloaded!
sandevistan-overload = NEURAL BREAKDOWN! Implant emergency shutdown!

# Implant Names
ent-CyberwareNeuroSandevistanMk1 = Zetatech Sandevistan Mk.1
ent-CyberwareNeuroSandevistanMk1-desc = Entry-level neural booster. Moderately accelerates but quickly drains stamina.

ent-CyberwareNeuroSandevistanApogee = Militech 'Apogee' Sandevistan
ent-CyberwareNeuroSandevistanApogee-desc = Legendary booster. Allows moving faster than lightning at the cost of colossal mental strain.

ent-CyberwareNeuroSandevistanMaxTac = Militech 'Max-Tac' Sandevistan
ent-CyberwareNeuroSandevistanMaxTac-desc = Elite squad booster. Allows moving faster than lightning at the cost of colossal mental strain.

ent-CyberwareImplantAntiglare = Antiglare
ent-CyberwareImplantAntiglare-desc = Reduces glare from sudden flashes, protecting vision without additional effects.

ent-CyberwareImplantInfraredVision = IR Vision
ent-CyberwareImplantInfraredVision-desc = Cybernetic implant providing infrared vision, allowing sight in complete darkness. Can be toggled on and off.

ent-CyberwareImplantMicroVideo = Microvideo
ent-CyberwareImplantMicroVideo-desc = A camera in the eye. Records video and audio. Useful for reporters and streamers.

ent-CyberwareImplantMicroOptics = Micro-optics
ent-CyberwareImplantMicroOptics-desc = Cybernetic implant with optical zoom. Allows zooming in on distant objects.

# Actions
action-name-sandevistan = Sandevistan
action-desc-sandevistan = Activate neural booster. Drains stamina and humanity.

action-name-infrared-vision = IR Vision
action-desc-infrared-vision = Toggle infrared vision on/off

# Kerenzikov
ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMk1 = Moore Tech Kerenzikov
ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMk1-desc = Basic reflex booster. Slightly increases movement speed.

ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMk2 = Zetatech Kerenzikov
ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMk2-desc = Advanced reflex booster. Increases movement speed and improves evasion.

ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMk3 = Militech Kerenzikov
ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMk3-desc = Legendary reflex booster. Maximum movement speed and superior evasion.

ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMaxTac = Militech 'Max-Tac'
ent-CyberwareNeuroKerenzikovMaxTac-desc = Extreme reflex booster. Maximum movement speed and superior evasion. For tactical operatives only.

# Bio-Inhibitor
ent-CyberwareNeuroBioInhibitorStoic = Biotechnica 'Stoic' Bio-Inhibitor
ent-CyberwareNeuroBioInhibitorStoic-desc = Biotechnica specializes in biology and chemistry. Their pain suppressor is not just wires, but a gland embedded in the spinal cord that constantly injects a cocktail of synthetic endorphins and adrenaline into the bloodstream upon taking damage.

# Neuro-Blocker
ent-CyberwareNeuroBlockerAegis = Trauma Team 'Aegis' Neuro-Blocker
ent-CyberwareNeuroBlockerAegis-desc = Expensive medical standard. Trauma Team installs these on their paramedics so they can extract clients from crossfire even if they themselves get hit by a stray bullet.

# Tactical Suppressor
ent-CyberwareNeuroTacticalSpartan = Militech 'Spartan' Tactical Suppressor
ent-CyberwareNeuroTacticalSpartan-desc = Strict army standard. Designed for corporate wars. It literally severs neural connections responsible for transmitting pain signals to the brain, leaving only dry information about damage.

# Vampire Fangs
ent-CyberwareInternalVampireFangs = Vampire Fangs
ent-CyberwareInternalVampireFangs-desc = Dental implant that functions like a combat mode. Activates via action button to bite and drain blood.

ent-CyberwareInternalVampireFangsBasic = Basic Vampire Fangs
ent-CyberwareInternalVampireFangsBasic-desc = Simple dental implant for biting. No toxin injection capability.

# Polymer Skeleton
ent-CyberwareInternalPolymerSkeleton = Dynalar 'Frame' Polymer Skeleton
ent-CyberwareInternalPolymerSkeleton-desc = Budget bone reinforcement with impact-resistant plastic. Originally developed for miners and orbital station workers to minimize injuries from falling beams.

# Titanium Reinforcement
ent-CyberwareInternalTitaniumReinforcement = Kiroshi 'Phalanx' Titanium Reinforcement
ent-CyberwareInternalTitaniumReinforcement-desc = Police riot control standard. Bones are coated with a layer of titanium, significantly increasing the owner's body mass.

# Army Endoskeleton
ent-CyberwareInternalArmyEndoskeleton = Militech 'Monolith' Army Endoskeleton
ent-CyberwareInternalArmyEndoskeleton-desc = Extreme modification level. Natural bones are almost completely replaced with carbon-titanium alloys. The owner weighs one and a half times more than a normal human.

# Nasal Filters
ent-CyberwareInternalNasalFilters = Nasal Filters
ent-CyberwareInternalNasalFilters-desc = Implanted filtration system providing immunity to airborne gases and toxins.

# Enhanced Antibodies
ent-CyberwareInternalEnhancedAntibodies = Enhanced Antibodies
ent-CyberwareInternalEnhancedAntibodies-desc = Genetically enhanced immune system that accelerates natural regeneration processes.

ent-CyberwareInternalEnhancedAntibodiesTier3 = Enhanced Antibodies (Tier 3)
ent-CyberwareInternalEnhancedAntibodiesTier3-desc = High-level genetically enhanced immune system, maximizing regeneration processes.

# Kevlar Sublayer
ent-CyberwareExternalKevlarSublayer = Moore Tech 'Shell' Kevlar Sublayer
ent-CyberwareExternalKevlarSublayer-desc = Cheapest street protection. Layers of ballistic Kevlar are sewn under the skin. Protects against stray bullets from street gangs and shivs, but skin at installation sites becomes rough and loses sensitivity, and the body breathes poorly.

# Thermoplastic Armor
ent-CyberwareExternalThermoplasticArmor = Raven 'Aegis' Thermoplastic Armor
ent-CyberwareExternalThermoplasticArmor-desc = Standard for undercover detectives and mid-level corporate security. Not just fabric, but a smart polymer that hardens upon sharp kinetic impact, dispersing energy over a large area.

# Reactive Subdermal Layer
ent-CyberwareExternalReactiveSublayer = Militech 'Dragon Scale' Reactive Subdermal Layer
ent-CyberwareExternalReactiveSubdermalLayer-desc = Elite military development. Micro-scales of boron carbide and graphene connected by an elastic nano-mesh. Armor so strong it can stop a point-blank rifle bullet. Looks like a human, but feels like a concrete wall.

# Autodoc
ent-AutodocConsole = Autodoc Terminal
    .desc = A medical machine for safe cyber-implant integration. Requires a buckled patient.

# Roles
role-cyberpsycho-name = Cyberpsycho
role-cyberpsycho-objective = Kill everyone. Flesh is weak.

